    {
      "text": "白天建设自动化产线，夜晚按敌人弱点切换武器防守",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Night after night, exploit your enemy's varying weaknesses with different weapon combinations to defend your keep. During the day, invest in new weapons and upgrades, build your fortress, and plan for the upcoming fight.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2354330/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "炸矿卖钻石，再在熔炉、抓取器与弹药仓间分配投资",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Use explosives to mine diamonds, sell them in the shop, and invest wisely in enhancing the defenses of your keep. Will you choose a new smelter, grabbers for automation, expanding your weapon arsenal, additional ammunition storage, or defensive upgrades?",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2354330/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把火焰辣椒与回旋香蕉制成荒诞弹药",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Craft wacky ammunition like fiery peppers and boomerang bananas.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2354330/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
